{
  "layer": "sources",
  "note": "抓取配方。access=public 的可以服务端直接抓；access=login 的必须由油猴脚本在已登录的浏览器里抓，再 POST 到本机 /ingest。提取失败一律报错，绝不猜值。 规则宁紧勿松：宁可抓不到报失败，也不能把推广语当费率——「佣金直减10%」这类短语曾经把佣金率误抓成 10%。",
  "snapshot_dir": "data/snapshots",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-COMMISSION",
      "param_id": "P-TW-COMMISSION",
      "url": "https://shopee.cn/edu/article/26620",
      "access": "public",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "note": "A 级来源，重点做变更检测：平台改佣金率是低频但致命的事件",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "regex",
        "scope": {
          "after": "Shopee台湾站点调整",
          "before": "七、常见问题",
          "window": 1200
        },
        "group": 1,
        "scale": 0.01,
        "expr": "佣金[^0-9%直减励]{0,10}([0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+)?)\\s*%"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-TXN-FEE",
      "param_id": "P-TW-TXN-FEE",
      "url": "https://shopee.cn/edu/article/26620",
      "access": "public",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "regex",
        "scope": {
          "after": "Shopee台湾站点调整",
          "before": "七、常见问题",
          "window": 1200
        },
        "group": 1,
        "scale": 0.01,
        "expr": "交易手续费[^0-9%直减励]{0,10}([0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+)?)\\s*%"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-PRESALE-FEE",
      "param_id": "P-TW-PRESALE-FEE",
      "url": "https://shopee.cn/edu/article/26620",
      "access": "public",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "regex",
        "scope": {
          "after": "Shopee台湾站点调整",
          "before": "七、常见问题",
          "window": 1200
        },
        "group": 1,
        "scale": 0.01,
        "expr": "预售商品订单服务费[^0-9%直减励]{0,10}([0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+)?)\\s*%"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-TAX-THRESHOLD",
      "param_id": "P-TW-TAX-THRESHOLD",
      "url": "https://help.shopee.tw/portal/4/article/80088",
      "access": "blocked",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "regex",
        "expr": "新台幣\\s*([0-9,]+)\\s*元?以下",
        "group": 1,
        "scale": 1
      },
      "blocked_reason": "help.shopee.tw 打不开：urllib 接连失败，浏览器两次分别是 ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED 与 ERR_CONNECTION_TIMED_OUT（2026-10-03 实测）。这两条 A 级参数（P-TW-TAX-THRESHOLD 等）的官方原文因此拿不到，缺口记录在 spec/evidence/reachability.json。每天重试只会让每日任务恒返回失败码——改为默认跳过，要试就加 --include-blocked。"
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TH-VAT",
      "param_id": "P-TH-VAT",
      "url": "https://www.chinatax.gov.cn/chinatax/c102738/c5247291/content.html",
      "access": "public",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "note": "政府原文。2026-10-03 已用无头浏览器读到全文（urllib 因证书链验证失败读不到）；该页同时是 P-TH-VAT / P-TH-IMPORT-DUTY / P-TH-IMPORT-THRESHOLD / P-TH-MIN-EFFECTIVE-TAX / P-TH-PLATFORM-WITHHOLD 的 A 级来源。",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "regex",
        "expr": "增值税方面[^0-9%]{0,8}?([0-9]+(?:\\.[0-9]+)?)\\s*%",
        "group": 1,
        "scale": 0.01,
        "note": "锚点必须唯一。关键字「增值税」在本页出现两次：前文「进口关税和增值税，两项税负合计不低于17%」、后文「增值税方面。统一适用7%」。只用「增值税」会匹配到前一处，把 17%（关税+增值税合计）当成增值税率——实测踩过。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-FX",
      "param_id": "P-TW-FX",
      "url": "https://seller.shopee.cn/portal/finance/income",
      "access": "login",
      "review_cycle": "weekly",
      "note": "结算汇率要看本店账单，公开页没有。由油猴脚本抓，或每周手工抄一次",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "manual",
        "expr": "结算页的汇率数字"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-SLS-TIERS",
      "param_id": "P-TW-SLS-TIERS",
      "url": "https://seller.shopee.cn/portal/settings/shipping",
      "access": "login",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "note": "物流页的运费分档表。抓不到就人工抄，别猜",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "manual",
        "expr": "重量区间 + 对应运费"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "SRC-TW-DTS",
      "param_id": "P-TW-DTS",
      "url": "https://seller.shopee.cn/portal/order/list",
      "access": "login",
      "review_cycle": "quarterly",
      "note": "DTS 定义通常写在下单/发货页的提示里",
      "extract": {
        "kind": "manual",
        "expr": "出货天数说明"
      }
    }
  ],
